  "given": {"O": "The centre of a large star.", "A": "Halfway from O to the next large star."},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line through O and A and draw a circle about O through A. A large star will sit at O and at every point two radii away along the grid.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through O. At the four points where the circle meets the two lines, rule lines at right angles to them: the square cell. A small star will sit at each of its corners.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "P0": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "P180": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "P90": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "P270": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "P0", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "P180", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "P90", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "P270", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "K": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rule the diagonal through O and the corner K, the diagonal at right angles to it, and the line halving the angle between the horizontal and the diagonal: the 22.5° line.",
      "create": {
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "r22": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["P0", "O", "K"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Rule the line from the corner K to the bottom of the circle. Where it crosses the 22.5° line, rule a vertical down to the horizontal: that point is the tip of the large star. Draw the circle about O through it.",
      "create": {
        "kq": {"line": {"through": ["K", "P270"]}},
        "Q": {"point": {"meet": ["kq", "r22"]}},
        "qv": {"line": {"through": "Q", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "B0": {"point": {"meet": ["qv", "h"]}},
        "cb": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "B0"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["K", "P270"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The large star is two squares in this circle. Mark where the circle meets the horizontal, the vertical and the two diagonals, and join every other mark: one square on the horizontal and vertical marks, one on the diagonal marks. Rule each side as a full line.",
      "create": {
        "B90": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "B180": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "B270": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "B45": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "B135": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 135.0}}},
        "B225": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 225.0}}},
        "B315": {"point": {"meet": ["cb", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 315.0}}},
        "bs0": {"line": {"through": ["B0", "B90"]}},
        "bd45": {"line": {"through": ["B45", "B135"]}},
        "bs90": {"line": {"through": ["B90", "B180"]}},
        "bd135": {"line": {"through": ["B135", "B225"]}},
        "bs180": {"line": {"through": ["B180", "B270"]}},
        "bd225": {"line": {"through": ["B225", "B315"]}},
        "bs270": {"line": {"through": ["B270", "B0"]}},
        "bd315": {"line": {"through": ["B315", "B45"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["cb"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The next large star along sits two units away, so its tip lies as far beyond A as this star’s tip lies before it. Put the compass on A, open it to the tip, and mark the other side. Through that mark, rule the line parallel to the large star’s side B0–B90: a side of the neighbouring star that crosses this cell.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The next large star along sits two units away, so its tip lies as far beyond A as this star’s tip lies before it. Put the compass on A, open it to the tip, and draw the circle: it marks the neighbouring star’s tip on the other side.",
      "create": {
        "ca": {"circle": {"centre": "P0", "through": "B0"}},
        "N0": {"point": {"meet": ["ca", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "nd": {"line": {"through": "N0", "parallelTo": "bs0"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["A", "B0"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Rule the horizontal through the top of the large star; it meets the right side of the cell. Draw the circle about the corner K through that point: the circle of the small star.",
      "create": {
        "tb": {"line": {"through": "B90", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["tb", "gx"]}},
        "cs": {"circle": {"centre": "K", "through": "T"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["B90", "gx"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The small star is two squares in its circle too. Mark where it meets the two sides of the cell through K and the two diagonals through K, and join every other mark. Rule each side as a full line.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The small star is two squares in its circle too. Mark where it meets the two sides of the cell through K and the two diagonals through K, and join every other mark. Rule as full lines the sides the pattern runs along; the others are not needed.",
      "create": {
        "kd": {"line": {"through": "K", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "S0": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "gy"], "pick": {"angle": 36.139}}},
        "S90": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "gx"], "pick": {"angle": 53.861}}},
        "S180": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "gy"], "pick": {"angle": 57.764}}},
        "S270": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "gx"], "pick": {"angle": 32.236}}},
        "S45": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d45"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "S135": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "kd"], "pick": {"angle": 59.639}}},
        "S225": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d45"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "S315": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "kd"], "pick": {"angle": 30.361}}},
        "ss0": {"line": {"through": ["S0", "S90"]}},
        "sd45": {"line": {"through": ["S45", "S135"]}},
        "ss90": {"line": {"through": ["S90", "S180"]}},
        "sd135": {"line": {"through": ["S135", "S225"]}},
        "ss180": {"line": {"through": ["S180", "S270"]}},
        "sd225": {"line": {"through": ["S225", "S315"]}},
        "ss270": {"line": {"through": ["S270", "S0"]}},
        "sd315": {"line": {"through": ["S315", "S45"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["cs"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Copy the small star’s lines and the neighbouring star’s side to the other three corners, turning them about O.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Copy the small star’s lines to the other three corners, turning them about O.",
      "create": {
        "cp": {
          "repeat": {
            "of": ["nd", "ss0", "ss90", "ss180", "ss270", "sd45", "sd135", "sd225", "sd315"],
            "by": "rot4"
          }
        }
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Here the small star keeps only its square on the cell’s sides and diagonal through K. Mark where the diagonal through K at right angles to the first crosses that square’s two near sides: the middles of those sides. Through each, rule a vertical and a horizontal: the bands that run past the small square.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Here the small star keeps only its square on the cell’s sides and diagonal through K. Mark where the diagonal through K at right angles to the first crosses that square’s two near sides: the middles of those sides. Rule a vertical through one and a horizontal through the other: the bands that run past the small square.",
      "create": {
        "H1": {"point": {"meet": ["ss90", "kd"]}},
        "H2": {"point": {"meet": ["ss270", "kd"]}},
        "hv1": {"line": {"through": "H1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "hh1": {"line": {"through": "H1", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "hv2": {"line": {"through": "H2", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "hh2": {"line": {"through": "H2", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "cq": {"repeat": {"of": ["hv1", "hh1", "hv2", "hh2"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["kd"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "hidden": true,
      "text": "Mark the corners of the pattern: every point where a band turns, crosses another or ends.",
      "create": {
        "M1": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "ss90"]}},
        "M2": {"point": {"meet": ["bd225", "ss90"]}},
        "M3": {"point": {"meet": ["gys", "ss270"]}},
        "M4": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "tb"]}},
